frontend`;\n- `npm run build` in `frontend`;\n- `docker compose up --build` for infrastructure + API + frontend;\n- `docker compose --profile test up backend-tests --build` for containerized tests.\n\n## Practical Invoice Validation Script\n\nUsing a real challenge PDF, validate field by field:\n\n- `numeroCliente`;\n- `mesReferencia`;\n- `itensFatura.energiaEletrica.{quantidadeKwh,valorRs}`;\n- `itensFatura.energiaSceeSemIcms.{quantidadeKwh,valorRs}`;\n- `itensFatura.energiaCompensadaGdi.{quantidadeKwh,valorRs}`;\n- `itensFatura.contribIlumPublicaMunicipal.valorRs`.\n\nThen validate computed metrics:\n\n- `consumoEnergiaEletricaKwh`;\n- `energiaCompensadaKwh`;\n- `valorTotalSemGdRs`;\n- `economiaGdRs`.\n\nReference evidence (sample invoice JAN/2024):\n\n- `numeroCliente`: `7204076116`\n- `mesReferencia`: `JAN/2024`\n- `energiaEletrica`: `50 kWh` / `R$ 47,75`\n- `energiaSceeSemIcms`: `456 kWh` / `R$ 232,42`\n- `energiaCompensadaGdi`: `456 kWh` / `R$ -222,22`\n- `contribIlumPublicaMunicipal`: `R$ 49,43`\n- `consumoEnergiaEletricaKwh`: `506`\n- `energiaCompensadaKwh`: `456`\n- `valorTotalSemGdRs`: `329,60`\n- `economiaGdRs`: `-222,22`\n\n</details>\n"},"fileKeys":[".env",".gitignore","backend/.dockerignore","backend/.gitignore","backend/.prettierrc","backend/Dockerfile","backend/eslint.config.mjs","backend/nest-cli.json","backend/package.json","backend/prisma/schema.prisma","backend/README.md","backend/src/app.module.ts","backend/src/main.ts","backend/src/modules/admin/admin.module.ts","backend/src/modules/admin/application/admin.service.ts","backend/src/modules/admin/presentation/admin.controller.ts","backend/src/modules/admin/presentation/dto/admin-upsert-user.dto.ts","backend/src/modules/audit/application/audit.service.ts","backend/src/modules/audit/audit.module.ts","backend/src/modules/auth/application/auth.service.ts","backend/src/modules/auth/auth.module.ts","backend/src/modules/auth/domain/auth-user.type.ts","backend/src/modules/auth/domain/role.type.ts","backe